      "role": "Full-viewport opening statement",
      "description": "Background: #1d3023 (Forest Depths) full-bleed. A flowing organic green shape (abstract 3D or CSS shape, vivid green tones) sits behind the text as atmospheric decoration. Headline: Arizona Flare Condensed weight 300 at 180px, color #f7f5f2 (Bone Linen), line-height 0.85, letter-spacing -5.4px. The second line of the headline appears in a slightly different weight/style for rhythmic contrast. Supporting paragraph: Arizona Flare at 18px, #eae6df, max-width ~420px. The hero occupies the full first viewport with generous side padding."
